{"id":"vod_sn_36563","vodId":"36563","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"钢铁交响乐","name_cn":"钢铁交响乐","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a97dd216798f7e562943f24d56936eee.jpg"},"summary":"钢铁交响乐是一款要收集名为钢铁的机器人，并自订改装来攻略关卡的战略模拟游戏。各关卡中，要互相切换雷达的 “指挥画面” 以及像是 TPS 的 “进军画面” 来进行游戏。玩家要在指挥画面中指定钢铁的移动路线，之后再切换成进军路线的话，钢铁就会自动按照玩家指定的路线前进。而钢铁在进军中遭遇到敌人的话也会自动展开攻击。所以玩家要一边看著进军画面，然后根据状况来随时切换指挥画面来下达新的指示。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:15","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ej2dxHKwVg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PpBdhkE56n1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rxBWNG0UVZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cEgHRhKKcE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qN0aWNvSSz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SZkyW7gNAQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fNDM2XuxuB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GRNaTXjvmf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9u06KVuG5Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4gF4gJwEHJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yz6rsv0sGu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RAyLJXniSK1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:21.176Z"}